  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in faith and comfort with this beautiful Jeminise Bible Verse Blanket. Crafted from soft, skin-friendly fabric and adorned with uplifting scriptures, this personalized throw is designed to bring peace and daily encouragement to your home. It’s a heartfelt keepsake for believers and a perfect way to cherish inspiration.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Features uplifting Bible verses and Christian themes to provide warmth, peace, and daily encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized with Love:</strong> Customize with a name or date, creating a unique and cherished keepsake for yourself or a loved one.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Skin-Friendly Fabric:</strong> Made from comfortable, skin-friendly material for a cozy feel during prayer and quiet time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Gift:</strong> An ideal religious gift for moms, grandmas, daughters, or friends for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and air dry without heat, designed for quick drying and lasting fluffiness.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>S/M/L/XL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
